  "translation": "Eupša ge kgoši ya Yisraele a bala ⟨את⟩ mangwalo, a gasa diaparo tša gagwe, a re: Na ⟨ke⟩ nna Elohim, go bolaya le go phedisa, gore yena o romela go nna go ntšha motho go bolwetši bja gagwe bja go tonya? Ka gobane nnete, tsebagang ⟨le kopa⟩ le bodeng, gore o nyaka kganelo le nna.",
